WEBVTT

00:17.120 --> 00:19.000
<b>Season Two</b>

01:30.110 --> 01:34.280
<b>Night Twenty-Two   Fight On, Hero!</b>

01:30.110 --> 01:34.280
<b>Night Twenty-Two   Fight On, Hero!</b>

01:35.870 --> 01:38.510
<i>Is that really Otonashi-senpai?</i>

01:41.340 --> 01:42.910
Something else is coming!

01:43.280 --> 01:45.880
<i>First a hero cosplayer, now a skeleton?</i>

01:46.450 --> 01:49.730
<i>Young Master, shall we 
begin by saving the hero?</i>

01:49.730 --> 01:50.200
<i>Yeah.</i>

01:50.840 --> 01:53.720
<i>But don't say my name 
when speaking with me.</i>

01:53.720 --> 01:55.730
<i>They might realize who I am.</i>

01:55.730 --> 01:57.000
<i>Very well.</i>

01:57.000 --> 01:59.090
<i>Then I shall call you only "Master."</i>

01:59.090 --> 02:01.070
<i>Refer to me as Larva.</i>

02:01.070 --> 02:04.400
<i>Got it. I'll handle this.</i>

02:05.210 --> 02:07.390
I don't you know who you are,

02:07.390 --> 02:09.560
but it seems safe to assume you're enemies.

02:10.200 --> 02:12.070
Are you on our side?

02:12.070 --> 02:13.510
<i>This voice...</i>

02:13.510 --> 02:17.490
<i>It really is Senpai. 
What is she doing in this world?</i>

02:18.010 --> 02:20.860
<i>Wait, why is she dressed like that?</i>

02:20.860 --> 02:22.440
<i>Not that I can talk.</i>

02:23.470 --> 02:25.410
<i>Voice changer on.</i>

02:26.250 --> 02:29.420
I've come to save the hero according 
to an agreement with the goddess.

02:29.710 --> 02:32.970
The demons will abandon 
Fort Stella and retreat north.

02:32.970 --> 02:36.240
You should be able to use your telepathy.

02:37.090 --> 02:39.920
Is that armor some kind 
of ancient equipment?

02:40.760 --> 02:44.230
So the goddess has pawns 
we didn't know about.

02:44.230 --> 02:46.400
I have no intention of fighting demons.

02:46.930 --> 02:51.530
If you'll retreat quietly, I promise I won't 
allow the hyumans to pursue you.

02:51.820 --> 02:56.160
I can't do that. 
I will kill the hero Hibiki here.

02:56.160 --> 02:57.610
Nor will I relinquish Stella.

02:58.140 --> 03:01.890
Move. I won't kill you if you 
don't try to protect the hero.

03:01.890 --> 03:03.440
I can't do that.

03:03.820 --> 03:06.830
I've already received my reward up front.

03:07.460 --> 03:10.390
Then I will kill you and the hero.

03:10.860 --> 03:14.300
My name is Io. Demon Commander Io.

03:16.260 --> 03:17.760
Won't state your name?

03:18.360 --> 03:22.020
I wasn't expecting to be interrupted 
by a white warrior for a second time.

03:23.390 --> 03:26.760
The hero has some incredible luck.

03:27.440 --> 03:28.630
Let's go!

03:30.340 --> 03:31.540
Well, well.

03:31.540 --> 03:33.420
He stopped Io's blow.

03:33.420 --> 03:34.530
Amazing.

03:35.170 --> 03:37.510
Hero of Limia, step back 
with your companions.

03:38.020 --> 03:40.290
He's unbelievably strong!

03:40.290 --> 03:42.890
Whatever you do, don't challenge 
him to a contest of strength!

03:43.620 --> 03:44.750
I'll take that into consideration.

03:46.650 --> 03:49.010
Not bad. However...

03:49.010 --> 03:51.030
I see. I don't have enough arms.

03:51.350 --> 03:53.250
Exactly!

03:53.810 --> 03:55.340
<i>Spin Step!</i>

03:56.280 --> 03:59.220
And you lack power!

04:08.270 --> 04:10.220
That backhand took down a dragon.

04:10.220 --> 04:13.240
Blocking it immediately was a good call.

04:13.240 --> 04:16.100
It scares me that that doesn't 
sound like a joke.

04:16.970 --> 04:19.850
Perhaps you'll entertain 
me more than Hibiki.

04:20.440 --> 04:22.390
<i>He's smiling. Scary.</i>

04:22.940 --> 04:25.670
Who is that man in white?

04:25.670 --> 04:27.850
That armor is rather tough.

04:28.140 --> 04:30.400
But he's up against Io.

04:30.400 --> 04:32.610
He needs our help.

04:32.610 --> 04:34.010
He does not.

04:34.890 --> 04:36.450
When did you get there?

04:36.450 --> 04:40.970
Your assistance would only get in my 
master's way against an opponent that weak.

04:41.920 --> 04:43.860
"That weak"?

04:43.860 --> 04:45.710
The skeleton is talking.

04:46.140 --> 04:50.980
By the way, did you purchase that sword from 
the Kuzunoha Trading Company in Tsige?

04:51.730 --> 04:53.340
You know that place?

04:53.340 --> 04:53.940
Yes.

04:54.330 --> 04:59.240
I once experimented with feeding wind 
spirits to monsters in the wasteland.

04:59.240 --> 05:02.270
That sword is made using materials 
from my experiments.

05:02.270 --> 05:04.250
You did what?

05:04.620 --> 05:06.940
Who are you?

05:06.940 --> 05:08.020
Larva.

05:08.020 --> 05:11.990
Your run-of-the-mill lich 
who likes to experiment.

05:14.850 --> 05:15.780
Hibiki!

05:15.780 --> 05:17.000
Damn it! More enemies!

05:19.550 --> 05:21.760
Don't move, hero of Limia.

05:22.150 --> 05:25.340
If you leave this barrier, 
I'll kill your friends.

05:26.290 --> 05:30.960
Your friends' safety was not part 
of our agreement with the goddess.

05:31.570 --> 05:35.690
As long as the hero is safe, we don't 
care what happens to the others.

05:35.690 --> 05:37.660
Then what do you want me to do?

05:37.660 --> 05:38.890
I shall handle them.

05:39.380 --> 05:42.190
You stay there and wait.

05:42.190 --> 05:43.900
What?

05:43.900 --> 05:46.320
How dare you?!

05:46.320 --> 05:50.280
You two, making more enemies 
now would be a bad move.

05:50.780 --> 05:52.810
Let's allow this gentleman to handle it.

05:52.810 --> 05:54.650
Let's see what you can do.

05:55.590 --> 05:58.610
Larva-dono, show us your power.

06:07.930 --> 06:10.130
Step back, lich.

06:10.130 --> 06:12.210
The hero is our prey.

06:13.100 --> 06:16.590
I know a bit about the tenacity of cattle.

06:16.590 --> 06:19.700
At home, they are troublesome 
and violent livestock.

06:19.700 --> 06:21.030
Livestock?!

06:21.030 --> 06:26.200
Fool. How does it serve you 
to enrage us unnecessarily?

06:26.200 --> 06:27.000
Now, let's see...

06:27.320 --> 06:31.970
Horses that can't even grow 
horns are too weak for me to ride,

06:31.970 --> 06:34.210
but I'm not sure about you.

06:35.090 --> 06:38.220
To be precise, I am a former lich.

06:38.220 --> 06:41.460
Why former? Allow me to show you.

06:41.460 --> 06:43.890
Come, Thirteen Steps.

06:45.310 --> 06:47.980
Release steps one through four.

06:48.300 --> 06:52.170
Wand, Sword, Cup, Coin.

06:55.590 --> 06:57.190
What is this?

06:57.560 --> 07:01.200
You must be excited to stand 
before your superior.

07:01.200 --> 07:03.230
Try to put up a fight.

07:07.930 --> 07:10.890
Well, well. The horse evaded it.

07:10.890 --> 07:13.870
The cow... survived it.

07:13.870 --> 07:15.040
Bastard!

07:15.040 --> 07:16.990
Damn mage!

07:16.990 --> 07:18.740
Now burn.

07:21.710 --> 07:23.860
Don't worry, it doesn't hurt.

07:23.860 --> 07:26.010
Now offer your lives to me.

07:26.640 --> 07:28.520
He's wrecking them.

07:28.520 --> 07:30.120
What do you think you're looking at?

07:30.120 --> 07:30.720
Whoops.

07:32.850 --> 07:34.620
You think this will be easy?

07:35.080 --> 07:39.350
No. I'm fighting an opponent more 
skilled than me in hand-to-hand combat.

07:39.350 --> 07:40.660
It's not easy at all.

07:41.210 --> 07:45.740
Yeah, right. Not a single one of my 
attacks has been effective against you.

07:45.740 --> 07:49.110
Anyway, your men died. Don't you care?

07:49.390 --> 07:53.560
Everyone who attacked the royal 
capital had steeled their resolve.

07:53.560 --> 07:58.000
Pitying their deaths would be an insult!

07:59.190 --> 08:02.710
Elemental gauntlets, huh? Wow.

08:03.150 --> 08:06.230
That sounded sarcastic!

08:06.870 --> 08:09.510
Just to clarify, are you 
sure you won't retreat?

08:09.860 --> 08:14.480
Of course. I don't intend to drag 
this fight out any further, either.

08:14.800 --> 08:15.850
I see.

08:16.630 --> 08:18.720
Larva, half-open seven.

08:18.720 --> 08:20.690
Very well.

08:21.090 --> 08:23.100
You're asking that lich for support?

08:23.100 --> 08:26.150
No, of course not. 
I'm having him buy time.

08:26.150 --> 08:28.980
So you're determined not to fight fair.

08:29.320 --> 08:34.440
My objectives are saving the hero and 
the fall of Fort Stella. That's all.

08:34.820 --> 08:38.500
I may have to fight someone in the future,

08:38.500 --> 08:40.910
so I don't feel like 
pointlessly exposing my hand.

08:41.750 --> 08:46.370
<i>Is he considering that he 
might have to fight a hero?</i>

08:46.760 --> 08:48.160
Now, then...

08:48.160 --> 08:50.120
<i>Selecting Killer Move.</i>

08:51.020 --> 08:53.430
<i>Firing claymores.</i>

08:53.930 --> 08:55.260
Claymores?

08:56.530 --> 08:57.460
Huh?

08:57.460 --> 08:58.720
I-Is that—

09:01.970 --> 09:03.380
<i>That doesn't seem right.</i>

09:15.670 --> 09:18.630
<i>Tracking weapons armed 
with explosive magic?</i>

09:18.630 --> 09:21.170
<i>I've never heard of such a thing.</i>

09:21.850 --> 09:23.860
Scissorhands Knuckle!

09:24.880 --> 09:27.460
It pierced my hardened skin?

09:28.430 --> 09:31.410
Scissors won't work. What else is there?

09:31.780 --> 09:34.340
<i>Select Anchor Shot?</i>

09:34.340 --> 09:35.220
Hey, nice.

09:37.540 --> 09:38.350
Hup.

09:39.440 --> 09:40.830
Heave-ho!

09:48.780 --> 09:51.690
<i>All right. Got a good one.</i>

09:55.810 --> 09:56.730
Huh?

09:57.600 --> 10:00.230
<i>He's regenerating at this speed?</i>

10:03.920 --> 10:05.990
<i>He can fly, too?</i>

10:05.990 --> 10:07.610
Let's see...

10:08.460 --> 10:09.950
<i>Activating.</i>

10:10.650 --> 10:14.610
Jet Kick!

10:22.430 --> 10:25.180
Demon Commander Io, 
it's about time you retrea—

10:25.180 --> 10:26.130
Hey!

10:26.510 --> 10:28.800
You monster!

10:29.470 --> 10:30.820
He's already regenerated.

10:30.820 --> 10:33.930
Larva-dono, your master is in trouble!

10:34.900 --> 10:37.290
Your advice is unnecessary.

10:37.290 --> 10:40.200
Equip and activate Seventh Step.

10:40.850 --> 10:42.710
Hell, half-open.

10:46.350 --> 10:49.140
To the city wall should do it.

10:49.460 --> 10:51.420
Go, Niffelheim.

10:55.080 --> 10:56.790
To the city wall?

10:56.790 --> 10:59.790
I will envelop this city in a weakening fog.

11:00.310 --> 11:03.700
The master said weakening would be enough.

11:03.700 --> 11:05.180
You should thank him for that.

11:15.240 --> 11:17.770
Oh, I felt that.

11:17.770 --> 11:21.280
You mixed in some kind 
of armor-piercing jabs.

11:21.280 --> 11:24.730
You're unscathed after all that?

11:24.730 --> 11:27.370
You're a total enigma.

11:28.200 --> 11:31.130
I'm not unscathed. That hurt pretty bad.

11:31.890 --> 11:37.090
I can't believe you can move 
around that much and regenerate.

11:38.360 --> 11:43.500
If not for these circumstances, 
I would've liked to enjoy fighting you.

11:43.500 --> 11:44.480
However...

11:54.040 --> 11:55.550
What was that about?

11:55.550 --> 11:58.040
Is that how demons pump themselves up?

11:58.040 --> 11:58.770
No.

11:59.340 --> 12:03.740
I told even my soldiers who I can't 
reach telepathically to use something.

12:04.200 --> 12:05.240
What thing?

12:05.520 --> 12:10.240
The latent strength of living beings 
is surprisingly deep and vast.

12:10.240 --> 12:15.170
I learned that from the woman in 
 white who was the hero's companion.

12:15.980 --> 12:18.120
Her name was Naval.

12:18.120 --> 12:20.270
What? Is that...

12:20.270 --> 12:21.580
No way.

12:22.060 --> 12:24.480
Is that a Rose Sign?

12:26.030 --> 12:27.290
Io.

12:30.160 --> 12:30.930
Master!

12:30.930 --> 12:34.640
That is an enhancing item 
known as a Rose Sign.

12:34.640 --> 12:39.890
It grants the user tremendous strength 
in exchange for consuming their soul.

12:40.490 --> 12:42.900
Not only that, but it's been modified.

12:44.040 --> 12:46.870
Your knowledge is impressive, lich.

12:46.870 --> 12:48.790
You gave those to your soldiers?

12:49.270 --> 12:51.580
No one will return from this battle alive.

12:51.880 --> 12:57.030
They'll slaughter all the hyumans 
with this instant strength boost.

12:59.040 --> 13:04.020
Now, let's see what the improvements 
Rona made are capable of.

13:04.410 --> 13:10.960
You should be pleased, white-clad. 
I deem you worthy of using this on.

13:22.680 --> 13:25.860
I see. Incredible.

13:26.910 --> 13:29.700
Here comes Demon Commander Io!

13:31.830 --> 13:33.580
Rose Signs?

13:34.140 --> 13:37.210
If the demons outside use those, as well...

13:37.210 --> 13:40.200
We have to save the people of the city!

13:41.090 --> 13:42.670
You're right.

13:43.010 --> 13:44.090
Let's go!

13:44.090 --> 13:45.140
Yeah!

13:48.690 --> 13:50.630
What is this? A barrier?

13:50.630 --> 13:51.710
Larva-dono.

13:52.140 --> 13:55.080
You again, skeleton? 
Don't trap us in here!

13:55.080 --> 13:56.690
Let us out!

13:57.170 --> 13:59.440
Larva-dono, dispel this barrier!

13:59.960 --> 14:00.930
No.

14:01.390 --> 14:05.000
Don't be ridiculous! We're going 
to bring the city under control.

14:05.000 --> 14:07.660
We won't allow the demons 
to slaughter the people!

14:07.660 --> 14:11.210
Don't make me say it again. My goal is—

14:11.210 --> 14:13.430
Don't worry about me!

14:13.430 --> 14:16.200
We know everything there is to know 
about the royal capital's geography.

14:16.590 --> 14:18.950
We'll wipe out the demons before you know it.

14:18.950 --> 14:20.970
We won't die that easily!

14:21.410 --> 14:22.470
Please!

14:26.770 --> 14:28.290
You hyumans...

14:31.050 --> 14:34.870
In that case, try breaking through 
this barrier yourselves.

14:36.260 --> 14:41.990
It was based on a fairly powerful 
barrier known as Cocytus.

14:42.300 --> 14:45.930
If you cannot break through this, 
then who do you expect to save?

14:46.650 --> 14:51.120
If we break through this barrier, 
you won't stop us from going into the city.

14:51.120 --> 14:52.900
Is that right?

14:52.900 --> 14:55.040
I'll consider it.

14:55.650 --> 14:58.330
<i>Only consider it.</i>

14:59.000 --> 15:00.300
Hibiki...

15:04.020 --> 15:07.020
<i>It's okay. I can do it.</i>

15:35.660 --> 15:37.440
Hibiki!

15:37.440 --> 15:38.900
<i>I can keep going.</i>

15:39.550 --> 15:43.370
<i>I am a hero. More...</i>

15:43.870 --> 15:46.290
<i>I need more power.</i>

15:52.560 --> 15:55.010
Where am I?

15:57.180 --> 16:00.510
Welcome, traveler between worlds.

16:00.510 --> 16:01.170
Who are you?

16:01.600 --> 16:04.010
I don't know how to answer that.

16:04.010 --> 16:06.440
This is the only time we'll meet.

16:06.850 --> 16:08.880
If you need something from me, it can wait.

16:08.880 --> 16:11.650
There's something I need to do right now.

16:11.650 --> 16:13.440
Don't be in such a hurry.

16:13.440 --> 16:16.100
Only your consciousness is here.

16:17.990 --> 16:21.990
Any time that passes in here is 
less than a moment for them.

16:21.990 --> 16:23.760
So it's instantaneous?

16:24.160 --> 16:27.090
Yes. Shall we resume our conversation?

16:27.420 --> 16:32.050
Outsider from the original world 
and hero, Otonashi Hibiki.

16:32.340 --> 16:34.680
You know who I am.

16:34.680 --> 16:39.990
Of course. The other hero, 
Iwahashi Tomoki, also came here.

16:40.360 --> 16:41.550
Him, too?

16:41.830 --> 16:47.700
You've earned the right to receive 
the travelers' privilege.

16:47.700 --> 16:50.930
Can that make me stronger?

16:50.930 --> 16:57.030
That depends on you, and some abilities 
come with a price, but the answer is yes.

16:58.330 --> 17:00.960
I'm going to ask you a few questions.

17:00.960 --> 17:05.010
From your perspective, they'll probably 
all sound like they have no right answer.

17:05.910 --> 17:08.970
Now, what color are you?

17:15.510 --> 17:20.440
Thank you. I have your results, Otonashi Hibiki.

17:20.440 --> 17:22.660
Your color is black.

17:23.950 --> 17:24.840
Black?

17:25.250 --> 17:28.350
Yes. It's one of the highest-ranking colors.

17:28.350 --> 17:30.390
Tomoki was the same color.

17:31.780 --> 17:36.070
Black can never be acquired by the gods.

17:36.070 --> 17:39.340
Attack, defense, healing, support...

17:39.920 --> 17:42.410
It's quicker to name what it <i>can't</i> do.

17:42.990 --> 17:45.880
It's also known as "all colors."

17:46.270 --> 17:48.010
All colors...

17:48.930 --> 17:51.550
Now I will make you your ability.

17:51.550 --> 17:56.010
Because Tomoki acquired an attack, 
you can't choose that.

17:57.630 --> 17:59.090
In that case,

17:59.090 --> 18:03.480
can I have an ability as broadly defined 
as one that conquers the world?

18:03.760 --> 18:11.990
Of course. In that case, the cost would be 
all your mana and 80% of life in the world.

18:12.470 --> 18:14.440
Well, that won't do.

18:16.470 --> 18:21.200
What about the ability to dispel all spells?

18:21.490 --> 18:23.490
That's no fun.

18:24.160 --> 18:28.400
You could learn dispelling 
magic if you worked at it.

18:28.610 --> 18:30.580
He can use it, too.

18:30.580 --> 18:31.120
Huh?

18:31.120 --> 18:33.090
You know him?

18:33.090 --> 18:35.660
Did he get that cosplay suit here?

18:37.720 --> 18:40.590
Nobody asked for that weird thing.

18:41.550 --> 18:45.750
I know him, but I doubt he'll ever come here.

18:47.950 --> 18:52.100
So, what power will you choose?

18:55.520 --> 19:01.080
Could I use the emotions of 
others to strengthen myself?

19:01.500 --> 19:05.430
Turn others' emotions into your own power?

19:05.430 --> 19:09.460
I see. That's a truly heroic ability.

19:09.460 --> 19:12.550
Perfect for someone as charismatic as you.

19:12.550 --> 19:14.550
Can you or can't you make that?

19:14.950 --> 19:17.030
Of course I can.

19:17.030 --> 19:21.170
The cost is... a reduction of 
your maximum mana, I'd say.

19:21.170 --> 19:22.510
That's fine.

19:23.260 --> 19:25.380
In that case, Otonashi Hibiki...

19:26.470 --> 19:30.150
I shall grant you this ability.

19:31.950 --> 19:33.480
Hey, wake up!

19:33.480 --> 19:34.600
Hibiki!

19:34.600 --> 19:35.530
Hang in there!

19:35.530 --> 19:36.650
Hey, Hibiki!

19:39.420 --> 19:41.250
<i>Their feelings become...</i>

19:42.000 --> 19:45.210
<i>my strength!</i>

19:56.060 --> 19:57.200
Unbelievable.

19:58.060 --> 19:59.500
How was that?

19:59.500 --> 20:01.970
Per our agreement, 
we're going into the city.

20:04.640 --> 20:06.420
Wait, hero of Limia!

20:07.340 --> 20:09.430
Something's coming, Master!

20:10.180 --> 20:13.100
Seriously? I have to deal with 
them under these circumstances?

20:13.720 --> 20:15.730
Larva, go with the hero!

20:16.190 --> 20:16.980
Understood.

20:18.340 --> 20:20.990
Your opponent is over here.

20:20.990 --> 20:26.320
<i>When I consider my future with the demons, 
I don't want to kill Io now, but...</i>

20:35.600 --> 20:38.420
Aw, man. Are you okay with this?

20:38.420 --> 20:41.090
That attack was probably one of your allies.

20:41.370 --> 20:42.970
You know them?

20:42.970 --> 20:47.050
Then you must also understand 
that they can't be controlled.

20:47.050 --> 20:48.300
I don't doubt it.

20:49.030 --> 20:52.520
I'd like to at least weaken 
Io before they arrive.

20:53.050 --> 20:54.480
What have you got?

20:55.350 --> 20:57.470
<i>Spell Break is effective.</i>

20:57.920 --> 21:00.750
<i>When a hero equal to the enemy appears,</i>

21:00.750 --> 21:03.520
<i>you can forcibly dispel the 
enemy's enhancements.</i>

21:03.520 --> 21:04.920
A hero?

21:04.920 --> 21:06.100
Let's go!

21:06.540 --> 21:08.040
Investigative Kai.

21:09.800 --> 21:10.910
Found it.

21:11.400 --> 21:13.370
Spell Break!

21:17.860 --> 21:20.750
You bastard! What did you do?!

21:21.360 --> 21:24.220
I broke your Rose Sign thing.

21:25.670 --> 21:27.170
Still want to keep fighting?

21:29.050 --> 21:32.110
O dragon kings who live for an eternity.

21:32.110 --> 21:33.100
She's here.

21:33.440 --> 21:36.770
